<title>USA: NTN says shareholder lawsuit dismissed.</title>
<headline>NTN says shareholder lawsuit dismissed.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>NTN Communications Inc said Thursday a shareholder lawsuit accusing the company of excess severance payments and debt cancellations for departing senior managers had been voluntarily dismissed by the plaintiffs.</p>
<p>NTN said dismissal of the suit, which had been filed recently in California Superior Court, did not require a payment from the company.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
